		mes "[Paa]";
		mes "Paa is kind meow. So, I'll tell you story meow.";
		next;
		mes "[Paa]";
		mes "Ser cat is my twin brother. I was born first, but he always says he is the elder meow. But, I don't fight with Ser meow. I am a good brother meow.";
